          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiga ng’at laitoriatab Suria kiptainikab karisiekyik, kolenji, Amat obargei ak ne ming’in anan ko ne o kobate laitoriatab Israel inegei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer kiptainichoto bo karisiek Jeosapat, komwa kole, Nito ko laitoriatab Israel. Koweekyigei anyun kole kobargei ak inendet: ago kiwaach Jeosapat, ak kitoret Jehovah inendet; ago kiigochi Kamuktaindet ichek kobagakta inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer kiptainikab karisiek kole ma laitoriatab Israel ni, koweek, mata kosub inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King’i chito age kwangennyi komwok kosapsapchi, ak kitiech laitoriatab Israel ole tuiyechin karikyik che kiilaachi: kolenji anyun chito ne kweriei karinnyi, Imuta amanda eng’ oli mi luget; amu kagiguotena mising’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitesak luget betunoto: ago kitiigei laitoriatab Israel eng’ karinnyi kotokyigei Suriek agoi koskoleny: ak kingo negit kororokto asista, kome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
